WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.209
Cross-reference findings.

00:00:02.159 --> 00:00:06.045
Seven million government records, algorithmically analyzed.

00:00:06.045 --> 00:00:09.215
Twenty-six investigation findings published.

00:00:09.215 --> 00:00:13.988
Three thousand, one hundred and eighty decoded lobbying subject matter tags.

00:00:13.988 --> 00:00:18.034
This page shows you the patterns the government hoped no one would assemble.

00:00:18.034 --> 00:00:22.795
Seventy-three sitting Members of Parliament have been taken on paid trips to Israel.

00:00:22.795 --> 00:00:25.443
Conservative Party: thirty-five.

00:00:25.443 --> 00:00:27.909
Liberal Party: thirty-two.

00:00:27.909 --> 00:00:30.340
Bloc Québécois: three.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:32.340
NDP: two.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:36.545
Eight hundred and ninety-four thousand dollars total spent on those trips.

00:00:36.545 --> 00:00:46.124
The Centre for Israel and Jewish Affairs — CIJA — made two thousand, one hundred and fifty-six registered communications to nine hundred and ninety-three government officials.

00:00:46.124 --> 00:00:54.897
October 21st, 2025: CIJA met with thirty-seven MPs, one senator, and the Deputy Chief of Staff of the Prime Minister's Office.

00:00:54.897 --> 00:00:56.738
In a single session.

00:00:56.738 --> 00:01:03.568
Fifty-eight percent of MPs elected in 2025 had been lobbied or trip-sponsored by CIJA after the election.

00:01:03.568 --> 00:01:11.397
Eighteen point nine million dollars in military goods exported to Israel in 2024 — despite the government's announced export pause.

00:01:11.397 --> 00:01:16.943
Thirty-seven point two million in new military permits approved in February 2025.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:18.977
Including explosives.

00:01:18.977 --> 00:01:28.386
Every finding on this page is sourced from public records — Hansard, lobbying registrations, Elections Canada filings, Auditor General reports, and export permits.

00:01:28.386 --> 00:01:30.522
The algorithm connects.

00:01:30.522 --> 00:01:32.590
The human verifies.

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:36.636
The government's own data tells the story they hoped you would never read.
